										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Thursday Afternoon LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this afternoon. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class=" wp-image-106524 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="937" height="750" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x240.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x820.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Jurassic-World-77982-Spinosaurus-Dinosaur-Escape-August-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x615.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 937px) 100vw, 937px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deals include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Jurassic-World-77982/dp/B0G2T2MX9L?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=2ca35de186912cdfcbd975cee4792953&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Jurassic World Spinosaurus Dinosaur Escape 77982</a> at 20% off for <strong>$59.99</strong> (reg.$74.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Technic-Artemis-Launch-Building/dp/B0FMS8BW3K?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=27a27d39facea919d3f126d60e70d62a&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Technic NASA Artemis Space Launch System Rocket 42221</a> at 17% off for <strong>$49.98</strong> (reg.$59.99). You also can&#8217;t go wrong with the cute <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Disney-Classic-43296/dp/B0G2SYJSJ4?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=51cfc50d60f96860fb8d2c34a01bbc6d&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Disney Stitch &amp; Scrump 43296</a> at 20% off for <strong>$56</strong> (reg.$69.99).</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103098 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Technic-Space-42221-NASA-Artemis-Space-Launch-System-Rocket-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="592" height="865" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Technic-Space-42221-NASA-Artemis-Space-Launch-System-Rocket-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 592w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Technic-Space-42221-NASA-Artemis-Space-Launch-System-Rocket-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-205x300.jpg 205w" sizes="(max-width: 592px) 100vw, 592px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107959 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43296-Stitch-and-Scrump-June-2026-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="897" height="719" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43296-Stitch-and-Scrump-June-2026-Front-Box.png 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43296-Stitch-and-Scrump-June-2026-Front-Box-300x240.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43296-Stitch-and-Scrump-June-2026-Front-Box-1024x820.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43296-Stitch-and-Scrump-June-2026-Front-Box-768x615.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Disney-43296-Stitch-and-Scrump-June-2026-Front-Box-1536x1231.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 897px) 100vw, 897px" /></p>
<p>Below are 10 of our handpicked best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Afternoon, October 29, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
