										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a> has a few great LEGO deals right now. Note that <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada</a> did not list the regular price for a lot of them. But we did check them <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> and calculated the actual savings percentage for your convenience. Free shipping on orders above $35 for items sold by Wal-Mart Canada (free shipping not available for remote areas or for orders over 150lbs).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-101629 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="1174" height="787" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle.jpg 1174w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-300x201.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-1024x686.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-768x515.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1174px) 100vw, 1174px" /></p>
<p>My favourite deal would probably be the popular LEGO Marvel 76342 Spider-Man vs. Mysterio: The Daily Bugle at 23% off for<strong> $99.98</strong> (reg.$129.99). The set regular retail price is $129.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a>. It&#8217;s also currently on backorder status with an expected shipping date within 60 days at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> as well. At 23% off and in-stock at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a>, its not too bad!</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">5 Handpicked Best Wal-Mart Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, October 28, 2026</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>16% off &#8211; LEGO Creator 3in1 31387 Iconic Pirate Ship <strong>$130.18</strong> (reg.$154.99) &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $17.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> </em></li>
<li>47% off &#8211; LEGO Disney Frozen Elsa’s Ice Palace 43244<strong> $69</strong> (reg.$129.99) &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $129.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> </em></li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-89565 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43244-Elsas-Ice-Palace-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="683" height="708" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43244-Elsas-Ice-Palace-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 818w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43244-Elsas-Ice-Palace-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-289x300.jpg 289w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/LEGO-Disney-Frozen-43244-Elsas-Ice-Palace-Summer-June-2024-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x796.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107512 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="963" height="963" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 963px) 100vw, 963px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107511 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="964" height="990" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1169w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-292x300.png 292w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-998x1024.png 998w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31387-Iconic-Pirate-Ship-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x788.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 964px) 100vw, 964px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>23% off &#8211; LEGO Marvel 76342 Spider-Man vs. Mysterio: The Daily Bugle<strong> $99.98</strong> (reg.$129.99) &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $129.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> </em></li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-101626 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="885" height="871" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 885w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x295.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x756.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 885px) 100vw, 885px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-101628 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.jpg" alt="" width="1239" height="612" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures.jpg 1239w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-300x148.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-1024x506.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Minifigures-768x379.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1239px) 100vw, 1239px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-101627 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="634" height="877" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 634w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Marvel-76342-Spider-Man-vs.-Mysterio-The-Daily-Bugle-January-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-217x300.jpg 217w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 634px) 100vw, 634px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>27% off &#8211; LEGO DC Batman: The Batman Batmobile 76332 <strong>$28.98</strong> (reg.$39.99) &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $39.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> </em></li>
<li>19% off &#8211; LEGO Creator 3in1 Cute Hamster with a Flower 31376 <strong>$10.48</strong> (reg.$12.99) &#8211; <em>Regular retail price is $12.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> </em></li>
<li><strong>Shop Now:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36751&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wal-Mart Canada Online</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-103030 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31376-Cute-Hamster-with-a-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="688" height="670" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31376-Cute-Hamster-with-a-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 858w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31376-Cute-Hamster-with-a-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x292.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31376-Cute-Hamster-with-a-Flower-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x747.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 688px) 100vw, 688px" /></p>
