										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Three all-new LEGO Friends January 2027 sets have been officially revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Details for 42709 Pet Care &amp; Play Center, 42718 Friendship Party Bus and 42719 Heartlake City Shopping Mall would all be looked at (including US/Canada prices, release dates and set images).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113971 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-scaled.jpg" alt="" width="1443" height="487" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-300x101.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-1024x346.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-768x259.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-1536x518.jpg 1536w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Three-LEGO-Friends-January-2027-Sets-Front-Box-42709-42718-42719-2048x691.jpg 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1443px) 100vw, 1443px" /></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when the LEGO Friends January 2027 sets become available!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<ul>
<li>LEGO 42709 Pet Care &amp; Play Center</li>
<li>LEGO 42718 Friendship Party Bus</li>
<li>LEGO 42719 Heartlake City Shopping Mall</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<h2>Three LEGO Friends January 2027 Sets Revealed</h2>
<h3>42709 Pet Care &amp; Play Center January 2027: Release Dates, US/Canada Prices &amp; Minifigures Info</h3>
<ul>
<li>Retail Price: $99.99 USD / $129.99 CAD / £89.99 GBP / $? AUD</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 9+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 814</li>
<li>Official Release Date: January 1, 2027</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-113959 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Friends-42709-Pet-Care-Play-Center-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Friends-42709-Pet-Care-Play-Center-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Friends-42709-Pet-Care-Play-Center-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Friends-42709-Pet-Care-Play-Center-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Friends-42709-Pet-Care-Play-Center-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Friends-42709-Pet-Care-Play-Center-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
