										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>It is always worth having a second check at Amazon before buying your favorite LEGO sets. Here are some<span style="color: #ff0000;"> <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?bbn=6303772011&amp;amp;rh=n%3A6205517011%2Cn%3A%216205518011%2Cn%3A6303772011%2Cp_89%3ALEGO&amp;amp;dc&amp;amp;fst=as%3Aoff&amp;amp;qid=1584647603&amp;amp;rnid=7590290011&amp;amp;ref=lp_6303772011_nr_p_89_1&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=5d48afd4da2b974b81ef49387a5138e8&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon Canada</a> </span>deals I pick for today. Free shipping on orders above $35 CAD.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-99125 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6.jpg" alt="" width="893" height="598" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6.jpg 893w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6-300x201.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-6-768x514.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 893px) 100vw, 893px" /></p>
<p>My personal favorite is LEGO Disney Wall-E &amp; EVE 43279 at 27% off for <strong>$65.98</strong> (reg.$89.99) because I am a big fan of the movie. I recommend this for a Saturday family movie night.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/s?bbn=6303772011&amp;amp;rh=n%3A6205517011%2Cn%3A%216205518011%2Cn%3A6303772011%2Cp_89%3ALEGO&amp;amp;dc&amp;amp;fst=as%3Aoff&amp;amp;qid=1584647603&amp;amp;rnid=7590290011&amp;amp;ref=lp_6303772011_nr_p_89_1&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=5d48afd4da2b974b81ef49387a5138e8&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon Canada</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-99123 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3.jpg" alt="" width="895" height="600" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3.jpg 895w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-300x201.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-768x515.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 895px) 100vw, 895px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-99128 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Features-3.jpg" alt="" width="810" height="493" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Features-3.jpg 810w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Features-3-300x183.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-LEGO-Disney-43279-WALL-E-and-EVE-September-2025-Release-Date-Features-3-768x467.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 810px) 100vw, 810px" /></p>
<p>Below are 10 of our handpicked best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Today, October 28, 2026.</p>
<p>Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the Canada!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>10 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Today, October 28, 2026</h3>
