										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113908 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Marvel-67005-Marvel-What-if.-Doctor-Strange-Supreme-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1069" height="1069" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Marvel-67005-Marvel-What-if.-Doctor-Strange-Supreme-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Marvel-67005-Marvel-What-if.-Doctor-Strange-Supreme-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Marvel-67005-Marvel-What-if.-Doctor-Strange-Supreme-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Marvel-67005-Marvel-What-if.-Doctor-Strange-Supreme-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-Marvel-67005-Marvel-What-if.-Doctor-Strange-Supreme-January-2027-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1069px) 100vw, 1069px" /></p>
<p>A brand-new upcoming Disney LEGO Marvel Super Heroes January 2027 set has been revealed LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Details for 67005 Marvel What if&#8230;? Doctor Strange Supreme would be looked at including US/Canada prices, release dates and minifigures.</p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll let you know when 67005 Marvel What if&#8230;? Doctor Strange Supreme becomes available!</p>
