										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Wednesday Morning Everyone. <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-110269 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-3-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Below are 8 of our handpicked best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, October 28, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>8 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, October 28, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Building-Project-Beautiful-Display/dp/B08HVXZW8X?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=9dca58d07a05014e080ac6f56325cfc0&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Botanicals Bonsai Tree 10281</a> <strong>$39.98</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6540429-TBD-Creator-31175/dp/B0DRW55T5H?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=1db7b074c5e9bc22c0ae951b8ef0ca1e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Creator 3in1 Unicorn Castle 31175</a><strong> $35.99</strong> (reg.$44.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-96536 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31175-Unicorn-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="667" height="690" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31175-Unicorn-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 854w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31175-Unicorn-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-290x300.jpg 290w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31175-Unicorn-Castle-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x795.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 667px) 100vw, 667px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-60405 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/18-January-2021-LEGO-10281-Bonsai-Tree-Box-Product.jpg" alt="" width="793" height="571" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/18-January-2021-LEGO-10281-Bonsai-Tree-Box-Product.jpg 1138w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/18-January-2021-LEGO-10281-Bonsai-Tree-Box-Product-300x216.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/18-January-2021-LEGO-10281-Bonsai-Tree-Box-Product-1024x737.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/18-January-2021-LEGO-10281-Bonsai-Tree-Box-Product-768x553.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 793px) 100vw, 793px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Technic-Monster-Digger-Building/dp/B0FMS5ZFSM?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=e802b31d303b6ef13e698225c3ee81aa&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Technic Monster Jam Grave Digger Fire and Ice 42219</a> <strong>$27.95</strong> (reg.$34.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-Harry-Potter-76469/dp/B0G2T4QGLN?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=77b570f1f58969f7f7dd385037aa4b43&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Dobby the Free Elf 76469</a> <strong>$23.99</strong> (reg.$29.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-108096 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76469-Dobby-the-Free-Elf-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="967" height="967" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76469-Dobby-the-Free-Elf-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76469-Dobby-the-Free-Elf-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76469-Dobby-the-Free-Elf-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76469-Dobby-the-Free-Elf-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Harry-Potter-76469-Dobby-the-Free-Elf-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 967px) 100vw, 967px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103109 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Technic-42219-Monster-Jam-Grave-Digger-Fire-and-Ice-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="866" height="845" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Technic-42219-Monster-Jam-Grave-Digger-Fire-and-Ice-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 866w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Technic-42219-Monster-Jam-Grave-Digger-Fire-and-Ice-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x293.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Technic-42219-Monster-Jam-Grave-Digger-Fire-and-Ice-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x749.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 866px) 100vw, 866px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>25% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Wars-Smart-Play/dp/B0FMYWMB4X?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=c6e7554a4fe0aaefbf74e21dc2967665&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars SMART Play: Luke’s Landspeeder 75420</a> <strong>$29.99</strong> (reg.$39.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Vanths-Speeder-Building-Girls/dp/B0FMS9FH2H?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=b0e1fbc62573d49bae17390aa47360bc&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars Cobb Vanth’s Speeder 75437</a><strong> $27.99</strong> (reg.$34.99)</li>
