<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6588548-TBD-Botanicals-11507/dp/B0G2T2MRNF?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=4bde45f16163f9e441d7ccb01ded3099&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Botanicals Olivia Rodrigo&#8217;s Flower Bouquet 11507</a> <strong>$39.99</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Botanicals-Flower-Building-Adults/dp/B0FMS4WZSY?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=ebddb586bd790c7c0ce131592e98b72b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Botanicals Peace Lily 11504</a> <strong>$39.95</strong> (reg.$49.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-101899 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11054-Peace-Lily-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="907" height="866" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11054-Peace-Lily-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 907w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11054-Peace-Lily-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x286.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LEGO-Botanical-Collection-11054-Peace-Lily-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x733.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 907px) 100vw, 907px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-110267 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1029" height="1029" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-Editions-11507-Olivia-Rodrigos-Flower-Bouquet-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1029px) 100vw, 1029px" /></p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>For the Amazon LEGO 2026 Deals, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/4dYMzLn" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/40WwLo0">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3TkFHyh" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3V3vjwl">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/4jKQPPG" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3Ofv2CG">Amazon UK</a></p>
<p><strong>For Amazon LEGO Bestsellers List, check it out right here:</strong> <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> | <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> | <a href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/3cyZVhx">Amazon UK</a></p>
