					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1031" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP 2026 Gift with Purchase Promotion Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1031px) 100vw, 1031px" /></p>
<p>LEGO November 2026 Promotions &#38; GWP Gift with Purchases are now live at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada &#124;</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-november-2026-promotions-gwp-gift-with-purchases-now-live-october-28-november-8-2026/">LEGO November 2026 Promotions &#038; GWP Gift with Purchases Now Live: October 28-November 8, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113739 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle.jpg" alt="" width="971" height="647" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 971px) 100vw, 971px" /></p>
<p>LEGO November 2026 Promotions &amp; GWP Gift with Purchases are now live at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). Check it all out below!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Worldwide GWP Gift with Purchase Promotions</span></h3>
<p>You can now get the LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Gift set that&#8217;s free with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD in LEGO purchases. This promotion runs from October 28 to November 8, 2026 or while supplies last. The set features 158 pieces and 1 minifigure. It has a recommended age of 18+ Adults Welcome.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113737 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="615" height="716" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 615px) 100vw, 615px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113742 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="660" height="768" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 660px) 100vw, 660px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Regional GWP Gift with Purchase Promotions</span></h3>
<p><u>US, Canada &amp; Australia</u></p>
<p>If you are based in US, Canada or Australia, you can now get the LEGO Star Wars 30685 TIE Interceptor Mini-Build GWP Gift set. This is free with LEGO Star Wars purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD. Offer runs from October 28 to November 8, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
