<p>Those in US, Canada or Australia are also eligible for a free LEGO Harry Potter 30724 Dumbledore&#8217;s Office with Harry Potter GWP Gift set. Though, this is limited to only selected Harry Potter LEGO purchases greater than $40 USD / $50 CAD / $65 AUD. Qualifying sets include the following:</p>
<blockquote><p>Hogwarts&#x2122; Castle: East Wing (76473), Book Nook: Dumbledore&#8217;s Office (76478), Dobby&#x2122; the Free Elf (76469), Hogwarts&#x2122; House Crest (76462), Knockturn Alley&#x2122; Wizarding Shops (76471), Hogwarts&#x2122; Herbology Plants (76474), Norbert: Hagrid&#8217;s Baby Dragon (76477), Forbidden Forest&#x2122;: Expecto Patronum (76475), Enchanted Flying Ford Anglia&#x2122; (76470), Cauldron: Secret Potions Classroom (76464), Hogwarts&#x2122; Castle: Hospital Wing (76463), Luna Lovegood&#8217;s House (76467), Hagrid&#x2122; &amp; Harry&#8217;s Privet Drive Escape (76459), Cornish Pixie (76461), Hogwarts&#x2122; Castle: Sorting Hat&#x2122; Ceremony (76460), Hogwarts&#x2122; Castle: The Main Tower (76454), Book Nook: Hogwarts&#x2122; Express (76450), Chomping Monster Book of Monsters (76449), Privet Drive: Aunt Marge&#8217;s Visit (76451), Quality Quidditch&#x2122; Supplies &amp; Ice Cream Parlour (76452), Knight Bus&#x2122; Adventure (76446), Hogwarts&#x2122; Castle: Herbology Class (76445), Thestral Family (76458), Hogwarts&#x2122; Castle: Flying Lessons (76447), Flying Ford Anglia&#x2122; (76424) or Hogwarts&#x2122; Castle: Charms Class (76442).</p></blockquote>
