					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1140" height="926" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO City 60497 Drive-Through Car Wash June 2026 Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Front-Box.png 1140w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Front-Box-300x244.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Front-Box-1024x832.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Front-Box-768x624.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1140px) 100vw, 1140px" /></p>
<p>Good Evening Everyone! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/11-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-october-27-2026/">11 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, October 27, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Evening Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-109464 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Lifestyle-2.jpg" alt="" width="1052" height="701" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Lifestyle-2.jpg 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Lifestyle-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Lifestyle-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Lifestyle-2-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60497-Drive-Through-Car-Wash-June-2026-Lifestyle-2-1536x1024.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1052px) 100vw, 1052px" /></p>
<p>My personal favorite deal would be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Drive-Through-Building-Playset-Minifigures/dp/B0G2T1X4SB?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=ff2c90b6dfd1bf8e7ca348691cb8557d&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Drive-Through Car Wash 60497</a> at 20% off for <strong>$47.99</strong> (reg.$59.99). Other of my favorite deals include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Botanicals-Magnolia-Branches-Building/dp/B0FMYXHYBR?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d7483e4861d669f21c8bf0f93791a1a9&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Botanicals Magnolia Branches 11510</a> at 22% off for <strong>$39</strong> (reg.$49.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Wars-Smart-Play/dp/B0FMYVYCY7?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=17f8e6d1ab74b11395a9cfccea42f98d&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars SMART Play: Millennium Falcon 75426</a> at 20% off for <strong>$79.95</strong> (reg.$99.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104520 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-11510-Magnolia-Branches-March-2026-Botanical-Collection-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="852" height="878" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-11510-Magnolia-Branches-March-2026-Botanical-Collection-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 852w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-11510-Magnolia-Branches-March-2026-Botanical-Collection-Release-Date-Back-Box-291x300.jpg 291w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-11510-Magnolia-Branches-March-2026-Botanical-Collection-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x791.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 852px) 100vw, 852px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104393 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75426-SMART-Play-Millennium-Falcon-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2.jpg" alt="" width="1118" height="746" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75426-SMART-Play-Millennium-Falcon-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2.jpg 1118w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75426-SMART-Play-Millennium-Falcon-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75426-SMART-Play-Millennium-Falcon-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75426-SMART-Play-Millennium-Falcon-March-2026-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1118px) 100vw, 1118px" /></p>
<p>Below are 11 of our handpicked best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, October 27, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
