<li>15% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Future-Machine-Building-Detailed/dp/B09TBMHCXL?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=a0c2688a6fc32d16bf3acf6517b9c241&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Icons Back to the Future Time Machine 10300</a> <strong>$170</strong> (reg.$199.99)</li>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Harry-Potter-Book-Nook/dp/B0DRW7WRX3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=374332c46076e1e929a74beb1288a59e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Harry Potter Book Nook: Hogwarts Express 76450</a> <strong>$79.99</strong> (reg.$99.99)</li>
