					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="858" height="854" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Star Wars 75425 SMART Play Mos Eisley Cantina March 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 858w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x764.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 858px) 100vw, 858px" /></p>
