										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Morning Everyone! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for this morning. Free shipping on orders above $35.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104386 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1079" height="862" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 1079w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x818.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x614.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1079px) 100vw, 1079px" /></p>
<p>My favorite deals include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6588578-TBD-Technic-42229/dp/B0G2SSNHNQ?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=0fd3c4e4d84383206ae04c2f46fe616b&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Technic Fast and Furious Mitsubishi Eclipse Car 42229</a> at 20% off for <strong>$51.99</strong> (reg.$64.99) and the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Star-Wars-Smart-Play/dp/B0FMYX7GPG?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=1f46e39c1582576c5b694e99b147bd30&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars SMART Play: Mos Eisley Cantina 75425</a> that&#8217;s been now further reduced by 33% off for <strong>$53.99</strong> (reg.$79.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-108661 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Technic-42229-Fast-and-Furious-Mitsubishi-Eclipse-Car-June-2026-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1046" height="836" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Technic-42229-Fast-and-Furious-Mitsubishi-Eclipse-Car-June-2026-Back-Box.png 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Technic-42229-Fast-and-Furious-Mitsubishi-Eclipse-Car-June-2026-Back-Box-300x240.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Technic-42229-Fast-and-Furious-Mitsubishi-Eclipse-Car-June-2026-Back-Box-1024x818.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Technic-42229-Fast-and-Furious-Mitsubishi-Eclipse-Car-June-2026-Back-Box-768x614.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Technic-42229-Fast-and-Furious-Mitsubishi-Eclipse-Car-June-2026-Back-Box-1536x1227.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1046px) 100vw, 1046px" /></p>
<p>There&#8217;s also a very small discount on a popular set as well. That&#8217;s the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-City-Trains-60506/dp/B0G2T3YJ43?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=80a31b3d8e77751ced18ae7f2823e167&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Classic Beach Streetcar 60506</a> at 10% off for <strong>$67.49</strong> (reg.$74.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-109520 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1034" height="821" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box.png 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-300x238.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-1024x813.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-768x610.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-1536x1219.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1034px) 100vw, 1034px" /></p>
<p>Below are 8 of our handpicked best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, October 27, 2026</p>
<p>Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don&#8217;t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<h3>8 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for This Morning, October 27, 2026</h3>
