<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND New York Parking &amp; Food Guide – Final Thoughts</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can pay full price for parking and meals at the hotel, or you could grab discounts and a few other perks. One way I recommend is to become an annual passholder.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">With the passholder, you can bring a friend, enjoy parking benefits, and receive hotel and dining discounts. For dining, you can get up to a 20% discount. And if you insist on bringing something with you, the park allows small, personal snacks and small, reusable water bottles.</span></p>
